# ---- 2.10 updates, rollout and database generation ----
case | schema.newer_database | 2.10 |  | A database newer than the build is refused (UnsupportedSchemaDowngrade) and not stamped; accepted when the version matches
case | schema.older_database | 2.10 |  | A database an earlier build shipped is never migrated or adopted (typed SchemaTooOld, the reset offer); a fresh one is accepted
case | schema.older_unshipped_database | 2.10 |  | A stamp below the first shipped one is damage, refused as CorruptSchema (no reset offer); a fresh one is accepted
case | schema.unstamped_with_tables | 2.10 |  | A database with tables and no version stamp is refused (CorruptSchema); a fresh one is accepted
case | rollout.InvalidVersion | 2.10 | VersionRefusal::InvalidVersion | an unparseable version is refused; the next manifest or wider rollout allows it; an equal or older version is never offered
case | rollout.Withdrawn | 2.10 | VersionRefusal::Withdrawn | a withdrawn version is refused; the next manifest or wider rollout allows it; an equal or older version is never offered
case | rollout.KillSwitched | 2.10 | VersionRefusal::KillSwitched | a kill-switched release is refused; the next manifest or wider rollout allows it; an equal or older version is never offered
case | rollout.BelowMinimum | 2.10 | VersionRefusal::BelowMinimum | a version below the channel minimum is refused; the next manifest or wider rollout allows it; an equal or older version is never offered
case | rollout.NotOffered | 2.10 | VersionRefusal::NotOffered | a release not offered to this install is refused; the next manifest or wider rollout allows it; an equal or older version is never offered
case | rollout.NotServed | 2.10 | VersionRefusal::NotServed | a stale appcast item other than the served version is refused; the next manifest or wider rollout allows it; an equal or older version is never offered
case | rollout.HeldBack | 2.10 | VersionRefusal::HeldBack | a release outside the staged rollout is held back; the next manifest or wider rollout allows it; an equal or older version is never offered
